#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid ""
"Child theme of Storefront for a Finnish bag & luggage store. Mobile-first "
"product cards, trust signals, clearer product pages and accessibility fixes "
"– all through hooks, without copying parent templates, so Storefront updates"
" stay safe."
